        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:82.68110656738281,5.276974678039551,394.3188934326172,374.72302532196045",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Folio 1v (first section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>&ldquo;[ ... ... ] if you do not find me nor my body, on the cross&mdash;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I ascended to the firmament of Heaven, and you will not see me.&rdquo; They crucified him</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>alive, and stoned him with stones, and he died on the cross.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And they did not want to take him down from the cross. R. Yehoshu\u02bfa said to them:</p>\n</li>\n<li>[&ldquo;Because of Yeshu the wick]ed we shall change the law of the Torah?&nbsp;</li>\n<li>\n<p>[For it is written, &lsquo;Do not let his corpse remain&nbsp;overnight] on the cross&rsquo;, etc.&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>R. [Yehoshu\u02bfa] said: [&ldquo;Bring him down] from the cross.&rdquo; They buried him in the [water]-channel</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[in the gar]den of R. Yehudah the gardener.&nbsp;When these</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[peop]le whom he had misled came, they did not find him on the cross;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>they surrounded and caught [the Jews and] said to them:</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&ldquo;Yeshu our master told us the truth, (that) the Jews are dealing with a lie. If</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>If you crucified him on the cross, where did his body go?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>In [truth], he ascended to Heaven.&rdquo; Pelatus the governor summoned</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Yehudah the gardener, and said to him: &ldquo;The man whom you (pl.) have crucified&mdash;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>what did you (sg.) do with his body?&rdquo;&nbsp;R. Yehudah answered: &ldquo;My master! Yeshu the wicked</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>knew what is written in the Torah, &lsquo;Do not let his corpse remain overnight on the cross&rsquo;, and he misled these people,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and said to them, &lsquo;If you come and do not find me</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>on the cross&mdash;I ascended to Heaven&rsquo;. And now, if</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>our master wishes, I will bring him, and will show his body</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
